{"name":"描述列表","description":"在详情页里用“字段名 + 内容”展示一条记录的只读信息 · 例如订单详情会显示“收货人：李明”“状态：已发货”“金额：¥199”。它只负责查看；如果用户需要修改这些内容，应使用可编辑的 表单 Form 。","quote":"详情页把信息列清楚就行：名称、时间、状态，一项一项的。","agentPrompt":"请把订单详情的只读信息改成“字段名 + 内容”的描述列表，不要使用禁用输入框。桌面可分列，手机改为单列；用长地址、空值和长状态文案检查对齐与换行。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-descriptions\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>描述列表<span>Descriptions</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">详情页把信息列清楚就行：名称、时间、状态，一项一项的。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">在详情页里用“字段名 + 内容”展示一条记录的只读信息</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>例如订单详情会显示“收货人：李明”“状态：已发货”“金额：¥199”。它只负责查看；如果用户需要修改这些内容，应使用可编辑的 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/form?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"form\" aria-label=\"表单 Form\">表单 <b>Form</b></a>。</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"desc-d bordered\">\n    <div class=\"d-row\"><span class=\"d-label\">项目名称</span><span class=\"d-value\">AI 图鉴</span></div>\n    <div class=\"d-row\"><span class=\"d-label\">创建人</span><span class=\"d-value\">ans-studio</span></div>\n    <div class=\"d-row\"><span class=\"d-label\">状态</span><span class=\"d-value\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">进行中</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"d-row\"><span class=\"d-label\">更新时间</span><span class=\"d-value\">2026-07-20 14:32</span></div>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请把订单详情的只读信息改成“字段名 + 内容”的描述列表，不要使用禁用输入框。桌面可分列，手机改为单列；用长地址、空值和长状态文案检查对齐与换行。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" view