lor:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none;border:1.5px solid #fff\">油</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">阿油</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"min-width:56px;color:var(--text-3);flex:none\">邮箱</span><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">you@example.com</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"min-width:56px;color:var(--text-3);flex:none\">角色</span><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">前端工程师</span></div></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">需要让用户<b>填写或修改</b>：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/form?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"form\" aria-label=\"表单 Form\">表单 <b>Form</b></a></div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">姓名</span><span class=\"mk-input \">林小hu</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">邮箱</span><span class=\"mk-input \"><em>you@example.com</em></span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>多行同类数据</b>：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/table?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"table\" aria-label=\"表格 Table\">表格 <b>Table</b></a></div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:56px;color:var(--text-3)\">任务</span><span style=\"width:44px;color:var(--text-3)\">状态</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:56px;color:var(--text)\">登录页</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">进行中</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:56px;color:var(--text)\">支付流</span><span class=\"mk-tag green\">已完成</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">字段很少且一句话即可说明：直接使用正文</div><div class=\"m